                { name = "Kingsbane", body = "#showtooltip Kingsbane\n/cast Kingsbane\n/castsequence reset=5 Thistle Tea, null", icon = 134400, desc = "and Thistle Tea Macro. For almost all scenarios, it is recommended to simply macro these two abilities together, so you will always be using a charge of Thistle Tea alongside Kingsbane . With the Castsequence modifier, you will avoid accidentally using multiple charges of Thistle Tea when spamming the button." },
                { name = "Tricks of the Trade — Tricks of the Trade", body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [@mouseover] Tricks of the Trade", icon = 134400, desc = "This macro will cast Tricks of the Trade on your mouse over target. This macro will cast Tricks of the Trade at your focus. This can be useful if you prefer this over the mouseover option. This macro combines the two macros from above. Also, if you have no mouseover target and no focus, then it casts Tricks of the Trade on your target's target (who is most likely going to be the tank if you are targeting the boss). Finally, this is a simple macro if you are usually casting Tricks on the same tank before or during each pull." },
